UPDATE leaders SET
  bio = 'Mr. Moses Komakech is an Information and Communication Technology (ICT) specialist, digital communications professional, graphic designer, and youth development advocate from Northern Uganda. He holds a Bachelor of Science in Information and Communication Technology from Gulu University.\n\nAs the Newsletter Editor of the Gulu University Convocation (GUCO), Moses contributes to the institution’s communication, storytelling, and information-sharing efforts, with a focus on documenting alumni achievements, institutional milestones, community engagements, and developments within the Convocation. He is passionate about strengthening alumni relations, preserving institutional heritage, and creating effective communication channels that connect graduates and inspire future generations.\n\nMoses brings professional experience in ICT systems administration, digital media, strategic communication, project coordination, and technology-driven innovation. He has worked across the technology, financial services, media, and nonprofit sectors, applying digital solutions to improve organisational efficiency, visibility, and engagement.\n\nBeyond his professional engagements, he is actively involved in youth leadership, mentorship, community development, and digital inclusion initiatives. He serves as a member of the European Union Youth Sounding Board (Season 2), where he contributes to discussions and initiatives around sustainable growth, inclusive development, and youth employment.\n\nThrough his work with GUCO, Moses is committed to promoting a vibrant alumni community, amplifying graduate voices, strengthening institutional identity, and ensuring that the stories and achievements of Gulu University continue to receive the recognition they deserve.\n\nAreas of Interest: Digital Transformation, Strategic Communication, ICT Innovation, Journalism and Storytelling, Youth Leadership, Entrepreneurship, and Community Development.'
WHERE organ = 'executive' AND title = 'Newsletter Editor' AND name = 'Mr. Moses Komakech' AND CHAR_LENGTH(bio) < 400;
